      "comment": "AUSSIE TRICKSTER (1) quickly away to win over the 297m at this track two runs back then settled forward again when finishing third at this track last start. Top prospect. REINA (3) has some solid form under her belt and proved too classy last time to win by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 17.73 beating Rocking Roma. Shapes as a top winning chance on latest effort. RUPEE'S SPECIAL (6) has a strong record here with two wins and a minor from six starts. Placed last time (15.93) at Cannington in a Free For All, finishing second and beaten 1.3 lengths. Can hit the frame with the right run. COOTAMUNDRA LAD (2) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
